        <h3><span class="update-way-logos update-way-logos-small"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{ platformLogos.chrome }}"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{ platformLogos.edge }}"/></svg></span>Chrome or Edge <span class="beta">Beta</span></h3>
        <p>Try updating on this page first. If the browser can't open the card, Windows needs a driver for it, which the easy flasher installs the first time it runs.</p>
        <p><button class="update-link" type="button" data-show-browser hidden>Use it in this browser</button></p>
