      <div class="update-way-panel" id="way-diy" data-way-panel="diy">
        <h3>Do it yourself</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/assets/bcv2/firmware/bcv2-rev1-product-latest.bin">Download the latest firmware</a>.</li>
          <li>Get a flashing tool: <a href="https://www.wch-ic.com/downloads/WCHISPTool_Setup_exe.html" rel="noopener">WCHISPTool</a> on Windows, or <a href="https://github.com/ch32-rs/wchisp" rel="noopener">wchisp</a> on Mac and Linux.</li>
          <li>Plug DATA into your computer, hold BOOT, plug a charger into POWER and let go.</li>
          <li>In WCHISPTool pick CH32X035, choose the file and press Download. With wchisp, run <code>wchisp flash</code> with the file.</li>
